# Copy to the .gitignore of the directory holding the live profiles.yaml
# (/srv/trentina/live in the reference unit), which is the one bound writable
# for config_tool (#633).
#
# The gateway writes two kinds of transient file in this directory: a random
# candidate it validates a change in, and the staging file an atomic replace
# renames from. Both are removed in the normal course of a write; these
# patterns keep a crash-time leftover out of a commit.
#
# A private key never belongs here — federation keys live under the gateway's
# data directory, not its config directory — but the last line is the kind of
# mistake worth refusing in advance rather than discovering in a push.
.profiles-candidate-*
.profiles.yaml.staged
*.pem
